The official music video for Ed Sheeran - Shape Of You

Taken from the studio album ÷ (divide) released in 2017, which featured the hit singles 'Castle on the Hill', 'Shape of You', 'Galway Girl', ‘Perfect’ & 'Happier'. 
 
